at3_standalone (FFmpeg ATRAC3/ATRAC3plus decoders) - LGPL-2.1-or-later
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This is the atrac3/atrac3+ decoders from ffmpeg, extracted to be standalone from ffmpeg.

ps3recomp: vendored from PPSSPP ext/at3_standalone at commit
ebc151f8f28beca7c07c9ec5d183fc6171c4a1fc, unmodified except that aac_defines.h
(unused) and PPSSPP's CMakeLists.txt were dropped. ppsspp_config.h and
Common/*.h are small shims standing in for PPSSPP headers; at3_bridge.* is a
C interface for libs/codec/cellAtrac.c.

The decoder sources are LGPL-2.1-or-later (see COPYING.LGPLv2.1 and the
headers of each file). They are kept in this directory as a separable
component; the rest of ps3recomp is MIT.

Compiled, unmodified, into libps3recomp_runtime.a (ps3recomp third_party/
at3_standalone; from PPSSPP's ext/at3_standalone, which extracts the decoders
from FFmpeg). Its complete source, the at3_standalone directory of ps3recomp
5fc2ef9f, ships in the download beside the prebuilt library. The library is
linked into thp8.exe on the player's own PC by the builder, so relinking
against a modified version of these decoders needs nothing more than
rebuilding libps3recomp_runtime.a and running the builder again (LGPL-2.1
section 6). The full license follows.

